1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,337
Welcome to the World of Revolution,

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:09,880
a dating sim set at the Royal Academy
with three princes to choose from.

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:15,820
But there's only one character I'd
choose, and that's Miss Claire!

4
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:22,620
I'm in love with you and
I don't care who knows it!

5
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:24,880
Claire Francois,

6
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,177
the spoiled bossy rich
girl who torments the hero

7
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,597
until her plans blow up
in her face at the end.

8
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:34,680
That's right, I'm in
love with the villainous!

9
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,500
I know no, kind of pride.

10
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,277
What you want to say not today?

11
00:00:57,360 --> 00:01:00,257
Oh I WANT only YOU!

12
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,977
I really hope you haven't told you.

13
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:09,840
Not too Too Hieracious.

14
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:19,570
Hey Houston!

15
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,520
Take care!

16
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,520
My name is Rei Ohashi.

17
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,918
I used to work for a small business.

18
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:18,057
The overtime was constant.

19
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:21,620
But playing my favorite game
at night helped me de-stress.

20
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,340
Or so I thought.

21
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,480
How deplorable!

22
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:29,957
You can't expect someone like me to
sit in class with someone like this!

23
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,017
But then, suddenly...

24
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:33,657
You conceived attempt at humor?

25
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:35,975
Lift up your head and face me at once!

26
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:37,617
Excuse me!

27
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,759
Are you listening?

28
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:42,080
I opened my eyes and there she was.

29
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,780
I told you to stand up!

30
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,937
I refuse to share a desk with a commoner.

31
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:47,726
You need to learn your place.

32
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,240
Claire, is that you?

33
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:51,920
How dare you!

34
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:55,417
Addressing me by name alone as
though you've earned that right!

35
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,877
Wait, right over there.

36
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,817
What's happening?

37
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:59,724
I know, that's what I'm saying.

38
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,700
This is just like the game.

39
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,878
Sorry, Miss Claire.

40
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,120
Was that so hard?

41
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:09,177
You must always remember the
proper way to address your betters.

42
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:10,380
I will, trust me.

43
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,422
And you remember my name, right?

44
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:16,420
Are you trying to insult me, Ray Taylor?

45
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:22,160
Taylor's the family name of the game's
protagonist, and Ray's the username I chose.

46
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,080
I seriously might pass out?

47
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:30,040
If this means what I think it does, then
have I been reincarnated in another world?

48
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,640
I love you. Huh?

49
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:38,437
I said I'm in love with you,
and I don't care who knows it!

50
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,500
What? What?

51
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,517
Unhand me, you miscreant!

52
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,937
Have you gone completely mad?

53
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:44,850
I don't think so.

54
00:03:44,933 --> 00:03:48,337
I am crazy in love with you, if
that's what you're asking me.

55
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:51,480
Honestly, do you think you
can curry favor with me?

56
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,800
I'm a noble.

57
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:56,777
No flowery words of love will soften
my disdain for a mere commoner.

58
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:58,720
Aw, you're so adorable!

59
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,577
Sorry, was that all loud?

60
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:03,131
Guess I got carried away.

61
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:06,440
By how ridiculously adorable
you are, that is! What?

62
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:08,620
Who exactly are you, anyway?

63
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:10,220
Someone you hate.

64
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,640
Isn't that right, Miss Claire? Yes.

65
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,817
I thought I had made that obvious.

66
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:16,620
I am 100 % okay with that!

67
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,797
In fact, you should keep
the bullying coming!

68
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,220
Please! I love it!

69
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,600
Y-Whaaa?

70
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:26,080
What a totally awesome start to a
super fun-filled school year, Ms.

71
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,010
Claire!

72
00:04:27,093 --> 00:04:28,837
I'll make sure you enjoy
every moment with me!

73
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,977
I cannot imagine why you would assume I'd

74
00:04:31,060 --> 00:04:33,766
want to associate with
you at all after today!

75
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:38,650
Ah!

76
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,350
Ray!

77
00:04:40,433 --> 00:04:41,263
Oh, my.

78
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,780
How silly of me.

79
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:47,942
The way you were just staring off into
space, I thought you were part of the decor.

80
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:49,370
Miss Claire?

81
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,200
What do you want?

82
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:53,674
I hope you're not expecting an apology.

83
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:55,200
That was incredible!

84
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:58,217
You've got your minions,
but you're so independent,

85
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:59,957
you pick on your targets yourself!

86
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:03,417
Way to totally subvert the bully
stereotype, you are so brave!

87
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:05,137
What are you even talking about?

88
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:07,396
I mentioned I love you, because I do!

89
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:12,910
Oh, no.

90
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:16,394
I thought it was an ugly bug,
but it was just your shoe.

91
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,510
Harder.

92
00:05:17,593 --> 00:05:19,280
I beg your pardon, commoner.

93
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:22,037
If you have something you want
to say to me, then speak clear.

94
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:25,238
I said if you're gonna step
on me, then do it harder!

95
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:27,257
Come on, I can feel you hesitating.

96
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:28,516
Show me some muscle.

97
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:32,557
You've got no reason to hold back on me,
so put your foot where your mouth is.

98
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:33,470
Huh?

99
00:05:33,553 --> 00:05:35,297
Wait, what happened to my book?

100
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:36,437
Oh, how sad.

101
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:40,402
Dad, are you so poor that you can't
afford even a single textbook?

102
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,640
I'm so sorry, Ms. Claire.

103
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:45,960
I was too stupid to see
what you were trying to do.

104
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:49,877
Well, it's about time
you learned your lesson,

105
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:52,017
you absolute - I can't believe
you wanted to sit next to me

106
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:55,688
in class so badly that you hid
my textbook to make it happen!

107
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,977
I mean, we're already safe neighbors,

108
00:05:58,060 --> 00:06:01,077
but I don't mind scooting
closer so that we can share.

109
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,990
Sure!

110
00:06:02,073 --> 00:06:03,779
You're making zero sense right now!

111
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:10,612
Honestly, Ray, I have no idea
what goes through your mind.

112
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:13,597
You just had to start the
year provoking people.

113
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:17,268
I can't say I'm surprised Miss
Claire's coming after you now.

114
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,660
I wouldn't say she's coming after me.

115
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:22,547
It's honestly more like
the other way around.

116
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:26,837
Listen, as your roommate, I
feel I owe you this morning.

117
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,685
Do not get on Miss Claire's
bad side this year.

118
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:30,980
Her family,

119
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:35,397
the House of Francois, is one of the most
prestigious families in the Bauer Kingdom.

120
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:39,120
If you upset her, there's
nothing she can't do to get even.

121
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,540
You worry way too much, Misha.

122
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,660
I'm from a ruined noble family.

123
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:47,917
Trust me, I know how these things work.

124
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,471
I get what you're saying.

125
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:52,620
But still, I love everything
about Miss Claire.

126
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:55,217
You love that she's a
self-serving princess?

127
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:57,557
How could anyone not fall for that wicked

128
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,857
gaggle she does when
she's being malicious?

129
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:02,999
She's my perfect evil queen
and I would die for her.

130
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,780
You truly are one twisted individual.

131
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:09,597
Here's the thing about Claire.

132
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:12,739
Even though she's a bully,
she only takes it so far.

133
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,877
She pushed me down in the
hallway where it was safe.

134
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,397
And she only hid my textbook.

135
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,951
She didn't throw it away.

136
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,120
See what I mean?

137
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,897
Please have faith in us, Miss Claire.

138
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:26,677
We would be more than happy to
take care of that commoner for you.

139
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,720
Absolutely not!

140
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:35,580
If I want her to submit to me, I'm more
than capable of making her do it on my own!

141
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,697
Even though everyone wants
to do favors for her,

142
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:40,997
Miss Claire would rather
bully others herself.

143
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,904
She's a proud person by nature.

144
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:46,320
She uses intimidation to
hide how fragile she can be.

145
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:51,307
I could never dislike her when
I understand who she really is.

146
00:07:51,580 --> 00:07:56,020
Maybe it's that complexity that
makes her so irresistible to me.

147
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:04,317
Uh how unsurprising no
one wanted to be your

148
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,397
partner that seems to happen to you lowly

149
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:11,560
commoners a lot teacher it's okay miss
claire said she'll be my partner no i did not

150
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:18,240
you're so filthy i thought
you were a pile of mud

151
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,320
It has no touching!

152
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,071
I'm so cold, Miss Claire.

153
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,259
Please warm me up.

154
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:29,920
Miss Claire, why is
this flower in my spot?

155
00:08:30,820 --> 00:08:35,077
Since it's my very first gift from you,
I'll press it so I can keep it always.

156
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:37,080
That is a weed, you utter moron!

157
00:08:38,220 --> 00:08:43,900
Don't you think that maybe
you're being a bit too resilient?

158
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,290
Huh?

159
00:08:45,373 --> 00:08:46,760
What do you mean by that?

160
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:52,340
I mean exactly that! That face!

161
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,357
Why on earth are you smiling
throughout my mistreatment?

162
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,270
Mistreatment?

163
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:57,780
You mean tough love?

164
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:58,900
Absolutely not!

165
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,117
Then what would you
call all this flirting?

166
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:03,557
How dare you speak to
me in anger, Ray Taylor?

167
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:06,817
Commoners must keep quiet and
devote themselves to hard labor!

168
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:10,018
But I am devoting myself to
the hardest labor of all.

169
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,880
The labor of love.

170
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:17,340
I can't take any more of
this girl! Yes, you can.

171
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:19,057
Don't you lose heart now, Miss Claire.

172
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:22,140
What doesn't kill you makes
you stronger, you know?

173
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,550
Wait!

174
00:09:27,633 --> 00:09:28,463
Where are you going?

175
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:30,420
I guess it worked.

176
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:32,917
You're being so resistant
to her bullying that Miss

177
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,882
Claire is about to quit
bothering you altogether.

178
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:37,370
What?

179
00:09:37,453 --> 00:09:38,283
Stop what I want!

180
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:43,127
What am I supposed to do if she
stops being mean to me, Misha?

181
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,790
I don't know.

182
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:50,022
I guess you could try becoming
someone she can't resist harassing.

183
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:51,760
Think about it.

184
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,857
If she's the kind of person who always has

185
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:56,317
to be the best and in
control of everything,

186
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,230
then...

187
00:09:57,313 --> 00:09:58,143
That's it?

188
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:01,677
If I behave the way my
avatar would in the game,

189
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,177
then Miss Claire will get competitive.

190
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:05,217
And then she'll have no
choice but to attack me.

191
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:07,397
Then I'll get to be close
to her and she'll attack

192
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:10,245
me again and again and
round and round it goes.

193
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:14,737
Less than a week into the term, and I've
gotten to spend so much time with her.

194
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,520
This feels like a win-win.

195
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,220
Hello, Miss Claire!

196
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,440
How are you today?

197
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:34,488
Stop right there, commoner!

198
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:36,797
How dare you greet her with familiarity!

199
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,357
Miss Claire belongs to a
completely different world than...

200
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:43,322
Whoa, I'm sorry, but I'm not
interested in talking to our minions.

201
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:46,177
I just wanted to say good
day to you, Miss Claire.

202
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:47,090
Hello.

203
00:10:47,173 --> 00:10:48,981
You embarrass yourself, commoner.

204
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:52,437
Strange that you'd think I'd
have anything to say to you.

205
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:54,277
Especially when you don't
understand that good

206
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:56,337
day is said when you
part ways with someone.

207
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:58,357
But you still talk to me
and you cared enough to

208
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,917
correct my mistake so that
I can be a better person.

209
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,830
I love you.

210
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:03,777
I've had enough of this from you!

211
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,697
You've been mocking me for days now!

212
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:07,898
These ridiculous jokes aren't funny!

213
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:10,637
You've become quite the
eyesore on this campus.

214
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,100
I suggest you leave.

215
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,720
Ladies, please.

216
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:17,771
It's too early to be making so much noise.

217
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:22,017
I totally forgot the object of the
game is to date the three princes.

218
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:23,865
I couldn't be less interested.

219
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:27,580
That's the first prince, Rod Bauer.

220
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,300
The second prince, Thane Bauer.

221
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:35,080
And of course, Few
Bauer, the third prince.

222
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,960
The Three Princes of Bower Kingdom,

223
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,477
which is where we are now,

224
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:42,897
and they're here because they're the
actual romance routes in the game.

225
00:11:42,980 --> 00:11:44,240
So what's going on?

226
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:45,797
You having fun without me?

227
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,351
Seems pretty rude of you.

228
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:48,719
Oh no, Prince Rod!

229
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:51,857
We weren't having any fun
whatsoever, I promise you!

230
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:54,517
I was just shooing away
a filthy little pest

231
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:57,057
who was trying to bring
disorder to this academy.

232
00:11:57,140 --> 00:11:58,617
Sorry, my hearing's not great.

233
00:11:58,700 --> 00:12:00,777
Did you say you wanted to
get disorderly with me?

234
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,331
I most certainly did not!

235
00:12:03,340 --> 00:12:04,820
Ray Taylor, wasn't it?

236
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,557
Good to finally meet the
highest-ranking new student.

237
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:08,581
Are you friends?

238
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,100
Um, yes, Prince Yu.

239
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:12,635
We went to the same elementary school.

240
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:16,537
She's certainly different from the
noble girls we usually see around here.

241
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:17,855
Gotta hand it to Dad.

242
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:22,842
His new merit-based admissions policy is
turning out some pretty hilarious results.

243
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:24,010
Thane!

244
00:12:24,093 --> 00:12:24,923
Care to say hello?

245
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:26,540
No, thank you.

246
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:29,240
Hello, Prince Thane.

247
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,340
Hey, Miss Claire!

248
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,397
Why don't you go over
there and talk to him?

249
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:36,060
Why would you suggest something like that?

250
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,940
Oh, I think you know why.

251
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,630
It's true.

252
00:12:39,713 --> 00:12:43,718
The one Miss Claire actually has
feelings for is Prince Over-It Thane.

253
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,280
You like him.

254
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,700
What an absolutely preposterous idea!

255
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:49,717
